design: one primary action treatment, tighter rail footer

Every action in the detail pane takes the primary treatment — white
ground, dark label — whatever the transfer is doing. Download, Pause,
Resume, Download again and Retry are the same control at different
moments, so they no longer change weight between states.

The rail's bottom padding stacked on the safe-area frame and left 17 dp
of dead space under the queue and settings buttons. Both paddings are now
one: the buttons sit 12 dp from the screen edge, level with the panel
inset on every other side.